---
const { siteName, author, url } = Astro.props;
---

<h1 class="center">Welcome Back to {siteName}!</h1>
<article class="intro">
    <img
        src="/images/rocket_comics_logo.png"
        alt="The original Rocket Comics logo."
        class="og-logo"
    />
    <p>
        In 1991, Mack Richardson opened the doors of Rocket Comics in
        Burlington, NC. It was an exciting time to be a comic book fan and,
        <b>doubly so</b>, for those who wanted to share their love of comics
        with others. Mack's shop was a place where fans could gather, talk about
        their favorite characters, and discover new stories. It was a comic book
        shop meant for comic book fans.
    </p>
    <p>
        Even though the shop has been closed for many years now, the spirit of
        Rocket Comics lives on. This site is a tribute to the shop and the fans
        who made it a special place.
    </p>
    <p>
        The comic book industry <i>(and world, at large)</i> has changed so much over
        the last 30 years. In many ways, it seems to be a much more challenging environment
        to successfully operate a comic book shop. That being said, plans are in the
        works to reopen Rocket Comics. <strong>Stay tuned!</strong>
    </p>
</article>
<style lang="css">
    /* ------------------------------------------------------------
   INTRO LAYOUT
   Mobile-first: stacked
------------------------------------------------------------- */
    h1 {
        margin-bottom: clamp(1rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    }
    .intro {
        clear: both;
        max-width: 80ch;
        margin-inline: auto;
        margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 6rem);
    }
    /* Keep captions readable but subtle */
    .intro figcaption {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        opacity: 0.8;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .intro > figure.handdrawn {
        max-width: 50%;
    }
    .intro figure.handdrawn figcaption {
        opacity: 1;
        margin: 0;
    }
    .og-logo {
        mix-blend-mode: multiply;
        display: block;
        height: auto;
        margin-inline: auto;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        width: 30%;
    }
    .og-logo::after {
        display: none;
    }

    /* ------------------------------------------------------------
   Widescreen: 3-column layout
------------------------------------------------------------- */

    @media (min-width: 64rem) {
        .og-logo {
            float: left;
            max-width: 250px;
            width: 25%;
            shape-outside: circle(50%);
            clip-path: circle(50%);
            margin: 0.5rem 1.25rem 1rem 0;
        }
    }
</style>
